OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with heavy rain at
OL,6,Ffirst. Rain clearing eastwards by
OL,7,Fmidday to leave a largely dry
OL,8,Fafternoon with long sunny spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping. Risk of a few passing
OL,10,Fshowers this afternoon. Breezy with
OL,11,Fstrong winds over the Western Isles.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers will largely die out
OL,14,Fthis evening leaving most places dry
OL,15,Fwith clear spells. Remaining windy on
OL,16,Fthe west coast with further showers
OL,17,Fthrough the night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
