OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FRather windy with showers in
OL,6,Fthe west, some heavy at times. Further
OL,7,Feast it will mainly dry, with the
OL,8,Flongest sunny spells around the Moray
OL,9,FFirth.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRather
OL,12,Fchangeable with showers or longer
OL,13,Fspells of rain on Friday, but
OL,14,Fgenerally drier on the weekend with
OL,15,Fjust a few light showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
